>And, how do you make the game remember what you named a previously
>unidentified item, and give that name to subsequent items
>that you find?  I had a wand of cancellation earlier, unidentified,
>but named CANCELLATION.  Shouldn't subsequent wands (I think
>in this case, jeweled wands) carry that name when I find them?

#name. It'll ask you if you want to name a specific item. Say no.
Whatever name you choose for the item, all other items of that type
will be named it.

